Syntax: innate
        innate <ability>

Some races possess innate abilities - magical or biological gifts
granted by their nature rather than learned through practice.  Unlike
class skills and spells, innate abilities have no learning curve and
no chance of failure.  They simply work.  Each ability has its own
cooldown that limits how often it can be used.

Typing 'innate' with no argument lists every racial ability your
character is born with, along with each ability's cooldown status -
either 'ready' or the time remaining until it can be used again.

Typing 'innate <ability>' invokes that ability.  Prefix matching is
allowed, so 'innate inv' will work as well as 'innate invis'.

Innate abilities are race-locked: only abilities granted to your race
appear in the list, and you cannot use abilities belonging to another
race regardless of how you might learn their names.

Currently, drow are the only race with innate abilities.  See 'help
drow' for the full list.

